      "message": "I\u0027m having a tough time reasoning about this one, too. We are an FP made from a blender. We have a child FP that\u0027s supposed to be invoked to produce our dst color. When that FP is invoked, we plumb our *incoming* dst color as the input color? Is that necessary?\n\nThe fact that we\u0027re doing this swap thing makes me wonder, though - what if that FP is another blender FP? It\u0027s going to do the swap again? Is that possible?\n\nSorry, this is all bending my brain a bit - might need to chat about it tomorrow to make sure we\u0027ve thought this through.",
